change(p, "- [ ] Preflight checks mode: CONCEPT_ONLY permits validated finalists through R04 only; SYNTHETIC_LAB permits marked fixtures; detailed production requires APPROVED_FOR_BIM with matching approval_hash, selected input versions, healthy registry and exact build.", "- [ ] Preflight checks mode: CONCEPT_ONLY permits finalists through R04; SYNTHETIC_LAB permits fixtures; detailed BIM permits APPROVED_FOR_BIM under AGENT_DELEGATED with matching approval_hash, decision evidence, selected input versions, healthy registry and exact build. AMANDA_REVIEW_PENDING is nonblocking. Real/unverified site input must be distinguished by STUDY profile and PROVISIONAL_ASSUMPTION; an unverified assumption cannot certify FINAL.")
