change(p, "Require resolved TYPOLOGY and valid SITE_BOUNDARY for the chosen production scope.", "Let the agent research and record TYPOLOGY and the best-supported SITE_BOUNDARY. If confirmation is unavailable, use a labeled provisional STUDY scenario and retain the corresponding verified/final checks as blocked; do not wait for aesthetic preferences.")
